* Fri Oct 23 2026 Jeremy Melanson <1080872+zish@users.noreply.github.com> - 1.0.0-1
- First release. Declares the "strongbox" keymaster@4.0 instance in Android's
  vendor VINTF manifest by a derive row: two inserted lines, between the image's
  own stock hash and the result keystore2 has bound since 2026-10-22. Ships no
  bytes of the manifest. Needs waydroid-overlay-sync 1.2.0 for insertions, and
  waydroid-ext-keystored, so the strongbox is never declared with nothing to
  serve it.
